---
description: Ponytail gate before every build action
alwaysApply: true
---

Before every action that writes code, adds a file, or adds a dependency, run the Ponytail skill (`~/.agents/skills/ponytail/SKILL.md`, level `full`) and print one line before acting:

`Ponytail: <reuse | platform | installed dep | new code> — <what>; skipped: <what>`

- Walk the ladder in order: does it need to exist, already in the repo, Next.js/web platform feature, installed dependency, one line, minimum code.
- Never cut: validation at trust boundaries, security, accessibility, anything in the PRD or `CURSOR_PLAN.md`.
- Design decisions (layout, type, colour, motion) belong to `design/Sample Dashboard.png` and `CURSOR_PLAN.md`; Ponytail decides how little code delivers them, not whether they ship.
- Run `/ponytail-review` before every pull request.
